{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/fb9a89bffdae4b54e055681d2055a58b.avif?t=1773653532\" width=616 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/26e89b447b6e2f25d67c40cb51de7f26.avif?t=1773653532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras_big/26e89b447b6e2f25d67c40cb51de7f26.webp?t=1773653532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/46e1c3ae3daf788666e5b476b6833662.avif?t=1773653532\" width=1240 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/57abc1528f8a1ba6e0b9e3f4b81570d8.avif?t=1773653532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras_big/57abc1528f8a1ba6e0b9e3f4b81570d8.avif?t=1773653532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of an ordinary technician's daily routine, every job can conceal a secret no one was ever supposed to discover\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a humble electronics repair shop owner. Through countless repair requests, you'll begin to unravel the disturbing truth hidden beneath the surface of Suka City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.