span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/2e8837ab30b26ed1df5056bb2f44e269.poster.avif?t=1773653532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/2e8837ab30b26ed1df5056bb2f44e269.webm?t=1773653532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/2e8837ab30b26ed1df5056bb2f44e269.mp4?t=1773653532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Suka City, steeped in corruption and raw desire, earn respect from underground. Collect everyone's info, break the chains of backroom deals, and expose the sexy mayor's conspiracy once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/a1d47c091a03c3ff1303fe6990579b82.avif?t=1773653532\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras_big/a1d47c091a03c3ff1303fe6990579b82.webp?t=1773653532 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576350/extras/36d4f914b04fc309fe4a3defb7cd64c1.avif?t=1773653532\" width=1240 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an ordinary tech-device repair shop owner. Interact with different cusotmers and explore new events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden photos, messages, and secrets buried inside their phones, and make your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it quiet.</p></li>